# Bella Virtual Staging

> Bella Virtual Staging (Bella Virtual) is a 3D rendering and virtual staging studio based in Vancouver, BC, serving home builders, developers, architects and real estate agents across the United States and Canada since 2017. Every image is made by human 3D artists and interior designers, never generated by AI.

Key facts (prices in US dollars; Canadian customers are charged in Canadian dollars at checkout):

- 3D interior rendering: from $550 per image (commercial interiors $700), typically 1–2 weeks depending on scope, revisions included until it's right, 4K delivery, full usage rights.
- 3D exterior rendering: from $750 per image (streetscape or aerial $1,000, multi-building $1,400), typically 1–2 weeks depending on scope.
- 3D floor plans: from $70 per plan, 24–48 hours. 2D floor plans from $20, also 24–48 hours.
- Virtual staging: from $37 per photo, MLS-ready in 24–48 hours, unlimited free revisions for two weeks.
- Contact: +1 (888) 471-2278, 838 West Hastings Street, Suite 801, Vancouver, BC.

